Limits
  Two Travel task templates with three deterministic seeds each
  Fixed oracle plans, not a model agent
  One controlled post-commit timeout and one unavailable-flight branch
  Compensation is limited to one pre-registered refundable hotel cancellation
  No schema adapter, general conflict recovery, symbolic user, scheduler, viewer, model/API, real account, external target, or network
  Results are local mechanism evidence, not a model or benchmark leaderboard score
